  "slug": "ningbo-dongqian-lake-marathon",
  "intro": "2019 年岁末，在浙江最大的天然湖泊东钱湖边，骑行、跑马、见老友，也走进奉化的历史深处。",
  "map": "/assets/cn-article-maps/china-light-c2c474ad46ce4cbc.png",
  "poster": "../../assets/cover-medal-ningbo-dongqian-lake-marathon.jpg?v=20260628-runcn-distinct-v1",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #294f7a; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">丨宁波 · 东钱湖丨</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #294f7a; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">- 宁波寄语 -</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #294f7a; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">是谁去宁波跑马，却囿于咖喱湖泊与爱</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">二零一九年的最后一个月，北方的寒夜，已是大雪纷飞，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">而我在南方的艳阳里</strong>，依旧四季如春。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">喜欢南方，就像喜欢清晨的第一缕阳光，但十二月的主题是<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #306eaa;padding-bottom:2px;\">告别</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">回东北前，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">东钱湖</strong>马拉松恰逢其时，画个42.195，去见见喜欢过的女孩，没有比这更好的的方式说再见了吧。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "骑行，刚刚好"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">东钱湖马拉松的举办地在宁波，宁波地处东南沿海，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\" style=\"color:#ac4336;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">是中国最古老的港口之一</strong>。唐代诗人白居易在《归田三首》中以“西京尘浩浩，东海浪漫漫”来描述西京长安和东海殊域两个迥异不同的世界。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">但我此行的目的不在看海</strong>，而是绕湖，即浙江最大的湖，东钱湖。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">我曾经听过一首诗“<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">尽说西湖</strong>足胜游，东湖谁言更清幽。一百五十客舟过，七十二溪春水流。”所以一直以为这是在夸武汉的东湖，后来才知道，袁士元是在说东钱湖。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">抵达宁波，先去取跑马装备，结果公交多坐了一站，直接到了东钱湖游客中心，偶遇了单车驿站。本来还在犹豫要不要骑车绕个湖，这一照面，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #9a681c;padding-bottom:2px;\">就坚定了我骑行的决心</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-001.webp",
      "caption": "单车驿站 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "单车驿站"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\" style=\"color:#ac4336;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #ac4336;padding-bottom:2px;\">对东钱湖来说</strong>，车行太快，步行太慢，唯有骑行，刚刚好。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-002.webp",
      "caption": "东钱湖骑行路线 Gif · 资料图",
      "alt": "东钱湖骑行路线 Gif"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">早晨10点钟租到单车，这一次算是全副武装，身后背着<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">Feiyu</strong>稳定器和Mavic无人机，车前夹着Osmo运动相机，戴上头盔，出发！</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-003.webp",
      "caption": "东钱湖骑行路线 文化宁波 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "东钱湖骑行路线"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">我的环湖路线是沿着东钱湖外环绕一个圈</strong>，可以说是图中几条路线的混合，大体路线是:</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">单车驿站—郭家峙—韩岭—十里四香—双虹阁—宁波雅戈尔动物园—东钱湖镇—单车驿站。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">出发不久，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #9a681c;padding-bottom:2px;\">我就在奉钱路上偶遇了马拉松赛道</strong>，指示牌清晰可见。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-004.webp",
      "caption": "1 公里里程牌 · 赛事资料",
      "alt": "1 公里里程牌"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-005.webp",
      "caption": "东钱湖沿湖路 · 赛事资料",
      "alt": "东钱湖沿湖路"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"0\" style=\"color:#ac4336;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">路过东钱湖</strong>白宫后就到了田螺山，这里流传着田螺姑娘的传说，也是钱湖八美的形象代言。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-006.webp",
      "caption": "田螺山航拍 · 航拍资料",
      "alt": "田螺山航拍"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-007.webp",
      "caption": "田螺山湖岸 · 航拍资料",
      "alt": "田螺山湖岸"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-008.webp",
      "caption": "田螺山下 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "田螺山下"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">我稍微加快骑行速度，大约在<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">16公里</strong>处来到网红韩岭，老街三面环山，一面临湖，岁月给这里留下一座江南古村。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-009.webp",
      "caption": "韩岭牌坊 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "韩岭牌坊"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">这里保留着过去的老房子，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #306eaa;padding-bottom:2px;\">能够回味出老宁波的住房特色</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-010.webp",
      "caption": "韩岭老街 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "韩岭老街"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">老街的角角落落，干净又充满生活气息，宁静又处处是人间的烟火气。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-011.webp",
      "caption": "韩岭老街航拍 · 航拍资料",
      "alt": "韩岭老街航拍"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-012.webp",
      "caption": "韩岭与东钱湖 · 航拍资料",
      "alt": "韩岭与东钱湖"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">离开韩岭，本来想着穿过小普陀，结果骑车没让进，所以最后继续绕湖，在下午的时间里来到前堰头村。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-013.webp",
      "caption": "韩岭人工岛航拍 · 航拍资料",
      "alt": "韩岭人工岛航拍"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">这时阳光正好，村前的小路上，一队情侣和跑步的大叔与我擦肩而过，索性我也停下，放个飞机，享受片刻在江南水乡午后的时光。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-014.webp",
      "caption": "前堰头村 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "前堰头村"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">剩下又陆陆续续穿过了一些村落和景区，回到驿站看自己不过骑行了<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #9a681c;padding-bottom:2px;\">43公里</span>，这与洱海<span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\" style=\"color:#ac4336;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">120公里</span>的路程相比，十分轻松，算是为马拉松热个身吧。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-015.webp",
      "caption": "脚感不错的战车 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "脚感不错的战车"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "跑马，爱爱爱不完"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">回归跑马话题，先说取装备，领物在东钱湖水上乐园里面，志愿者很贴心，应该是知道周边没有打印店，特意为选手们准备了报名确认函，自行填写即可。领物很顺利，虽然场面不大，但很高效。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-016.webp",
      "caption": "领物现场 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "领物现场"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">作为国内跑步氛围最好的城市之一，宁波一年会举报五场马拉松，而东钱湖马拉松，则是一年的最后一场。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-017.webp",
      "caption": "东钱湖路线 Gif · 资料图",
      "alt": "东钱湖路线 Gif"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">既然是收官战，自然是在岁末，即便是在江南，早晨的温度也就几度，所以选手们都是裹着羽绒服来到起点，然后恋恋不舍的脱掉。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-018.webp",
      "caption": "东钱湖晨光 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "东钱湖晨光"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-019.webp",
      "caption": "走向起点 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "走向起点"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">赛事起点有热身，大家挤在一起可以分享体温，齐唱国歌，令人热血沸腾，晨光暖色调的氛围也让我渐渐忘记了寒冷。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-020.webp",
      "caption": "起点处准备出发 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "起点处准备出发"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">主持人是韩乔生，之前在东北曾与他有过一面之缘，这次再次听到韩老师的声音更是觉得格外亲切。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-021.webp",
      "caption": "起跑 鼠爷",
      "alt": "起跑 鼠爷"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">迎着阳光起跑，很漂亮，这让我突然想到了海口，很熟悉的场景，我想，这次不会退赛了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-022.webp",
      "caption": "晨光 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "晨光"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">一公里处来到田螺山前，阳光洒在东钱湖上，画面感十足。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-023.webp",
      "caption": "田螺山前 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "田螺山前"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">接下来我们暂时跑离东钱湖，大家沿着鄞城大道一路跑向周边的村镇。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-024.webp",
      "caption": "赛道边啦啦队 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "赛道边啦啦队"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">我本来计划跟着430的兔子，结果状态还行就跑到了400兔子后面，前几个补给点只有水和饮料，我也不是很需要，十公里处，我才开始科学补充能量胶和一些水。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-025.webp",
      "caption": "补给点 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "补给点"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">再次和东钱湖相遇已是<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">20公里</span>，半马选手陆续跑到终点，赛道突然变得空旷。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">剩下的路程，对我们2000名全马选手才是真正的考验，温度渐渐回升，身子已经热开，跑起来还算舒服，再次路过韩岭老街，路边有稀松的加油声，我按照自己的节奏，不追不赶，一路向前。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-026.webp",
      "caption": "赛道抓拍 扑球单超",
      "alt": "赛道抓拍 扑球单超"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">中间<span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">30公里</span>左右的折返有点无聊，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #9a681c;padding-bottom:2px;\">33公里</span>的大上坡很虐，而35公里的大下坡简直爽翻，真是爬过了那一段两公里左右的上坡，后面都是坦途。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-027.webp",
      "caption": "连续上坡（虐） @Arsenan",
      "alt": "连续上坡（虐）"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-028.webp",
      "caption": "38K · 赛事摄影",
      "alt": "38K 下坡"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">最后的路程有茶园小妹妹加油，连续转弯路段山水相依，东钱湖镇偶遇国旗跑者，总之本该在撞墙的时候，赛道的乐趣大过了疲惫，也没有让我停下来走完比赛。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-029.webp",
      "caption": "官方赛照 · 赛事摄影",
      "alt": "国旗跑者"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-030.webp",
      "caption": "虾公山隧道 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "虾公山隧道"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">最后冲线408，虽然没有破4，但我挺满意的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-031.webp",
      "caption": "冲线 4:08 祥子",
      "alt": "冲线 4:08 祥子"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">跑完也不是很累，拉伸过后，还可以健步行走，奖牌颜值中规中矩，赛后的摆渡车数量足够，只是距离稍远，对于部分完赛选手不是很方便。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-032.webp",
      "caption": "终点志愿者 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "终点志愿者"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-033.webp",
      "caption": "奖牌 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "奖牌"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">总之，东钱湖马拉松对我来说算是一次很好的经历，虽然身体状态还没有调整到最佳，虽然要有一段时间不会比赛了。但这份对跑步的热情，我应该是爱不完的，我还会跑下去的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-034.webp",
      "caption": "抓拍瞬间 飓风",
      "alt": "抓拍瞬间 飓风"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "姑娘，这次不尴尬"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">我把这次出行定义为“东钱湖边的聚会”，跑马只是一个来宁波的理由，另一方面也是想看看老同学淼儿。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-035.webp",
      "caption": "淼儿 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "淼儿"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">我从不掩饰我对淼儿的喜欢，我们是高中和大学同学，淼儿也是我曾经追而不得的姑娘，现在的老铁。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">我想我们都经历过那些年少青涩的时光，当岁月让我们褪去尴尬，留下一份友情，难能可贵。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-036.webp",
      "caption": "印度咖喱和饼 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "印度咖喱和饼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-037.webp",
      "caption": "咖喱饭 淼儿 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "咖喱饭"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">骑行之后淼儿请我吃了印度咖喱，感受了宁波老外滩的风情。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-038.webp",
      "caption": "老外滩夜景 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "老外滩夜景"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-039.webp",
      "caption": "老外滩天主教堂 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "老外滩天主教堂"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">跑马后又约了宁波菜，老同学的热情让我感动，更有一种他乡遇故知的亲切。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-040.webp",
      "caption": "马拉松后的日落 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "马拉松后的日落"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">今年我们一起参加了高中老铁宝鑫的婚礼，深感随着年龄的增长，时间就像大浪淘沙，曾经无话不谈的朋友也渐渐变成了点赞之交，甚至最后连点赞都没了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">每次出行，如果时间允许，我都希望可以见见老朋友，如果爱情有保鲜期，友情才会历久弥新吧。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-041.webp",
      "caption": "老铁 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "老铁"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "双面，走近蒋介石"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">前不久我去了趟腾冲，深深震撼于这群国军远征军的坚韧。所以出于好奇，这次我又去了蒋介石的老家宁波奉化。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">在风起云涌的中国现代史上，蒋介石无疑是最复杂的“风云人物”之一，他经历了在台湾从神话到丑话的过程，也正在经历着大陆的去“漫画”进程，评价逐渐中立。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-042.webp",
      "caption": "雪窦山瀑布 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "雪窦山瀑布"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">跑马后的第一天，我先去了溪口雪窦山的妙高台，妙高台是蒋介石在1927年建造的私人别墅。这里也曾是蒋介石在下野时的幕后指挥部，见证了许多重大的战役。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-043.webp",
      "caption": "妙高台 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "妙高台"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-044.webp",
      "caption": "妙高台前景色 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "妙高台前景色"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">而在妙高台不远处，就是“雪窦山招待所”，曾是软禁张学良的地方，西安事变后，张学良由戴笠押送到溪口，然后被关进这里，对外称“张学良先生招待所”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-045.webp",
      "caption": "张学良雕像 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "张学良雕像"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">张学良押到溪口时才37岁，这一关一直关到90多岁，这里便是软禁他的第一站。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-046.webp",
      "caption": "张学良幽禁地 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "张学良幽禁地"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">回去路过雪窦寺弥勒，据说这是全球最高的坐姿铜制弥勒大佛，确实很震撼。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-047.webp",
      "caption": "铜弥勒 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "铜弥勒"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">下午拜访了蒋介石的老家宁波奉化，这里见证了蒋介石如何成长为一代风云人物的历程。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-048.webp",
      "caption": "武岭城门 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "武岭城门"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-049.webp",
      "caption": "奉化街景 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "奉化街景"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">城头的文昌阁则曾是蒋介石和宋美龄的私人别墅，里面的故事，至今依旧令人津津乐道。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-050.webp",
      "caption": "文昌阁内 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "文昌阁内"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-051.webp",
      "caption": "文昌阁航拍 · 航拍资料",
      "alt": "文昌阁航拍"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-052.webp",
      "caption": "文昌阁俯瞰 · 航拍资料",
      "alt": "文昌阁俯瞰"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">如今的奉化已经成了旅游景区，老乡们最常说的一句话就是“解放不忘共产党，致富不忘蒋介石”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-053.webp",
      "caption": "奉化溪碧潭桥 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "奉化溪碧潭桥"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-054.webp",
      "caption": "蒋氏故居 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "蒋氏故居"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">这几天正好赶上“国家公祭日”，我们受到的教育似乎总是告诉我们，南京是一场溃败，甚至是一场溃逃，老蒋不抗日。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">其实在南京保卫战前，蒋介石曾问下属：“谁负责固守南京为好？”回应他的，是死一般的沉寂。蒋介石说：“如果没有人守，我自己守。”</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">南京败势已定，蒋介石在日记“雪耻”条下写道：“十年生聚，十年教训。三年组织，三年准备。”这时他才决定离开南京。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">中山陵所在的紫金山，已褪去了往日的幽美，披上了由铁丝网、鹿砦和各种防御工事做成的伪装。蒋介石的随从副官蒋恒德后来回忆：眼见这一幕幕，蒋介石“神情怅惘，满面郁悒”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-055.webp",
      "caption": "文昌阁与奉化城 · 航拍资料",
      "alt": "文昌阁与奉化城"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">宁波奉化之行，让我看到了一个去漫画后的蒋介石，他有血有肉，也许历史对于他的争论永远不会停息，但这里的故事足够惊叹。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-056.webp",
      "caption": "奉化孩童戏水 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "奉化孩童戏水"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">宁波之行，我定义为是一场有温度，有深度的行走。我从来不是单纯的马拉松爱好者，世界真的太大了，谁不想去看看呢？马拉松是我的一种方式。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">晚年蒋介石的愿望是魂归奉化老家，虽然直至今日也未能成行，但即便身处海峡对岸，他对这片土地仍然爱得深沉。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Ningbo-Dongqian-Lake-Marathon-clean_files/img-057.webp",
      "caption": "热爱 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "热爱"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">世界很大，也可以走很远，但我想，作为华夏子孙，深耕于这片土地的热爱，永远不会消散。</p>"
    }
  ]
